# ==============================================================================
# ✒ Metadata
#     - Title: GitIgnore (Terrane Edition - v1.0)
#     - File Name: .gitignore
#     - Relative Path: .gitignore
#     - Artifact Type: config
#     - Version: 1.0.0
#     - Date: 11/11/2026
#     - Update: Wednesday, November 11, 2026
#     - Author: Dennis 'dendogg' Smaltz
#     - A.I. Acknowledgement: Anthropic - Claude Opus 5.5
#     - Signature: ︻デ═─── ✦ ✦ ✦ | Aim Twice, Shoot Once!
#
# ✒ Description:
#     Git ignore patterns for Terrane. Excludes dependency folders, logs,
#     editor and OS clutter, local secrets, and any holding area or journal
#     that a test run or a launch against the project itself leaves behind.
#     The vendored three.js and fonts in web/ are source and stay tracked.
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: none
#     - Compatible platforms: Git on Windows, macOS, Linux
# ==============================================================================

# Dependencies (there are none today; this keeps it that way by accident too)
node_modules/

# Terrane's own state, if the service is ever pointed at this directory
.terrane-trash/

# Logs and scratch output
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
.scratch/

# Local secrets and machine settings
.env
.env.*
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editors
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/

# OS and sync clutter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
~$*
